# Secret for functions/api/capi.ts (Cloudflare Pages Function that forwards
# Meta Pixel events to the Meta Conversions API). Only read server-side, only
# needed when running/previewing the Pages Function locally (wrangler pages dev).
# In production it's set via: npx wrangler pages secret put META_CAPI_ACCESS_TOKEN
#
# Note: META_PIXEL_ID is not a secret and does not belong here — it's already
# set as a plaintext var in wrangler.jsonc.
META_CAPI_ACCESS_TOKEN=
